# Amass with more than one Army (CR 701.47a, "put N +1/+1 counters on an Army you control"): which Army gets the counter is
# chosen, not targeted. Bot1's first Orcish Bowmasters makes an Orc Army token with one counter on turn 1, beside a Firdoch
# Core. On turn 3 the Core becomes a 4/4 artifact creature - a changeling, so an Army too - and the second Bowmasters' amass
# asks which Army; Bot1 picks the Core, which gets the +1/+1 counter, and the token stays at one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Orcish Bowmasters
Firdoch Core
Orcish Bowmasters
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Orcish Bowmasters.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Orc Army Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Firdoch Core.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Firdoch Core.Activate(Ability: becomes)
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Firdoch Core.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Orcish Bowmasters.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Firdoch Core)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Firdoch Core.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Firdoch Core.Power = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Orc Army Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
